      <p source="#source-574-618"><seg source="#source-574-580">あゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-580-595"><rb>終</rb><rt>つひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-595-618">の夕は来りぬ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-618-683"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-618-642"><rb>天昏</rb><rt>てんこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-642-645">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-645-666"><rb>地昏</rb><rt>ちこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-666-683">にさはなる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-683-736"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-683-707"><rb>不浄</rb><rt>ふじやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-707-736">はもこゝに亡ぶか、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-736-816"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-736-766"><rb>洗礼女</rb><rt>あらはれめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-766-772">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-772-793"><rb>河原</rb><rt>かはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-793-796">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-796-811"><rb>葦</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-811-816">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-816-842"><seg source="#source-816-842">法涙の露無量光、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-842-894"><seg source="#source-842-854">新らしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-854-875"><rb>生命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-875-894">の慈相――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-894-956"><seg source="#source-894-897">十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-897-912"><rb>夜</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-912-933"><rb>法会</rb><rt>ほうゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-933-956">の跡さびしき、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-956-985"><seg source="#source-956-985">天台の寺院の堂に、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-985-1020"><seg source="#source-985-1020">いからしく波うつ霧や、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1020-1067"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1020-1044"><rb>仏龕</rb><rt>ぶつがん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1044-1067">の虫ばむ音は、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1067-1102"><seg source="#source-1067-1102">悲しとも、これも自然が</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1102-1161"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1102-1117"><rb>法</rb><rt>のり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1117-1132">の座へ辿る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1132-1153"><rb>足音</rb><rt>あのと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1153-1161">ぞ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1161-1208"><seg source="#source-1161-1167">きけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1167-1182"><rb>葦</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1182-1208">のさなす小琴に、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1208-1240">霊のうた『血汐は白し</p>
      <p source="#source-1240-1290"><seg source="#source-1240-1261">血は白し、こや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1261-1285"><rb>敬虔</rb><rt>うやまひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1285-1290">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1290-1334"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1290-1314"><rb>古瓶</rb><rt>ふるがめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1314-1334">の封を破らず</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1334-1384"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1334-1349"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1349-1364">をまち考え</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1364-1376"><rb>伏</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1376-1384">して</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1384-1439">いまぞいま『自然』に<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1414-1429"><rb>浸</rb><rt>ひた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429-1439">す、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1439-1498"><seg source="#source-1439-1451">白き血に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1451-1466"><rb>映</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1466-1469">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1469-1493"><rb>大天</rb><rt>おほあめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1493-1498">、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1498-1554"><seg source="#source-1498-1510">白き血を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1510-1522"><rb>吸</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1522-1528">へや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1528-1552"><rb>大地</rb><rt>おほつち</rt></ruby></p>
      <p source="#source-1554-1604"><seg source="#source-1554-1569">ありとある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1569-1590"><rb>孤独</rb><rt>こどく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1590-1604">のものは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1604-1645"><seg source="#source-1604-1619">静寂の法に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1619-1637"><rb>帰依</rb><rt>きえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1637-1645">して</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1645-1707"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1645-1660"><rb>黙</rb><rt>もだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1660-1678">しつゝ白き血</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1678-1693"><rb>飲</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby>め』と、</p>
      <p source="#source-1707-1750"><seg source="#source-1707-1750">きくからに身も溶けごゝち。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1750-1800"><seg source="#source-1750-1765">見かへれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1765-1786"><rb>喬木</rb><rt>おほき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1786-1800">のしげみ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1800-1844"><seg source="#source-1800-1818">天台の寺院は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1818-1833"><rb>闇</rb><rt>やみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1833-1844">に――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1844-1897"><seg source="#source-1844-1859">うなだれて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859-1883"><rb>物思</rb><rt>ものおも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1883-1897">ひ立てる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1897-1938"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1897-1912"><rb>己</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1912-1938">が身も小河も葦も</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1938-1961"><seg source="#source-1938-1961">大法の一切滅に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1961-2018"><seg source="#source-1961-1988">あゝなべて見えざる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1988-2012"><rb>光輝</rb><rt>かゞやき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2012-2018">――</seg></p>
    </body>
